{
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Channelers of the magic of creation, luminaries are philosophers, muses, and healers of the people.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Luminaries</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Aerith Gainsborough, Final Fantasy VII</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Goldmoon, Dragonlance</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Nynaeve Sedai, The Wheel of Time</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Ophilia Clement, Octopath Traveler</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Luminary</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Luminary is a high-support healer. It’s recommended that you avoid direct melee.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Cast</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Midline/Backline</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Starting Pack:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Devout</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Key Stat:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Awareness</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training</strong></b></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Weapons:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> –</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Skills:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Mysticism, and 3 from either Arcana, Detect, Influence, Leadership, or Medicine</span></p>",
